5
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:37.280
With Deep Seek version 4.1 flash arriving today, that gap between nominal control and real control feels especially immediate.

6
00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:50.000
So the way that I think about AI right now is if somebody has AI and they compete against somebody in the same thing without AI, the person with AI will win effectively 100% of the time.

7
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.120
Do you disagree with that?

8
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:51.840
I agree with that.

9
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:56.240
