10
00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:56.800
Totally agree.

11
00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:57.040
Yes.

12
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:03.520
What I'm saying is what happens when a human versus an AI alone, an AI, an autonomous AI, and the autonomous AI wins every time.

13
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:06.560
So it's the autonomous part that's important for your definition.

14
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.120
Yes.

15
00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.280
I think autonomy is very important here.

16
