When I say autonomy, I mean, you know, both in the obvious sense of the term, but also like obviously if you just have a human rubber stamp yes on everything, that doesn't count as oversight.

17
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:26.480
So that would still count as autonomous to me, even if there's technically a human involved, but the UN doesn't even understand what the system's doing and they're just rubber stamping all the decisions.

18
00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:34.880
Well, like what I expect is happening, for example, is that they're probably will continue to be human CEOs for quite a while, but they just rubber stamp what the AI CEOs tells them to do.

